# Copy this file to .env and edit it. .env is ignored by git; this file is
# the contract for what .env may contain.
#
# Every declared location <name> resolves in this order, and the first hit
# wins:
#
#   1. LAB_<NAME>          an explicit override for that one location
#   2. $LABDATA/<name>     the default: a subdirectory of LABDATA
#   3. error               resolution fails, and the error names every
#                          missing location at once, not only the first
#                          one it encountered
#
# LABDATA is the only required variable. Nothing under it is ever committed:
# input data is mounted read-only from outside the tree (see docs/data.md).
# Never point any location inside this repository.
LABDATA=/absolute/path/to/labdata

# Optional overrides. Uncomment one only to move that location elsewhere.
#
#   LAB_RAW       raw input datasets: opened read-only, never written to
#   LAB_DERIVED   derived artifacts: read-write, regenerable, never committed
#
#LAB_RAW=/absolute/path/to/raw
#LAB_DERIVED=/absolute/path/to/derived
